TEXT 568 -248 Left 2 ;NOTE: P,Q Measurement for load should be seperated for all three phases\nYou can also use the power measurement by calculting p(t)=v(t)*i(t) for all\nthree phases seperated ( in the waveformviewer set x-axis to 200ms-400ms\nand then ctrl-click on the waveformname (below) to get the AVG-Value)\nv(n008)*Ix(Load:L1) 200ms-400ms + ctrlclick = AVG = 9.643MW\nv(n012)*Ix(Load:L2) 200ms-400ms + ctrlclick = AVG = 10.191MW\nv(n016)*Ix(Load:L3) 200ms-400ms + ctrlclick = AVG = 10.181MW\nSum: 30.015MW
